From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saifuddin Hitawala <hitawala@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:28:59 -0700
Subject: [gl] Check gl reset status for 0 glGen texture ids

Update glGenTextures to CHECK that the glGetGraphicsResetStatus
does not have GL_NO_ERROR. This ensures that when glGenTextures fails
and returns 0u, there is some error associated such as OOM, context
lost, etc.

Bug: 568891853
Change-Id: I581a4fbace2b4d465131ca0666a9323f34334638
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8684465
Reviewed-by: Vasiliy Telezhnikov <vasilyt@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Saifuddin Hitawala <hitawala@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1731975}

diff --git a/ui/gl/gl_gl_api_implementation.cc b/ui/gl/gl_gl_api_implementation.cc
index 7f0c401f8070f6509fa3661d863ca5c9e4189bd4..0101b3e40ab0d971442d06da2cb26b96aa125dbb 100644
--- a/ui/gl/gl_gl_api_implementation.cc
+++ b/ui/gl/gl_gl_api_implementation.cc
@@ -268,8 +268,12 @@ const GLubyte* RealGLApi::glGetStringiFn(GLenum name, GLuint index) {
 
 void RealGLApi::glGenTexturesFn(GLsizei n, GLuint* textures) {
   GLApiBase::glGenTexturesFn(n, textures);
-  if (GetGLImplementation() != kGLImplementationMockGL && n > 0) {
-    CHECK_NE(UNSAFE_TODO(textures[0]), 0u);
+  if (GetGLImplementation() != kGLImplementationMockGL && n > 0 &&
+      UNSAFE_TODO(textures[0]) == 0u) {
+    // On texture generation failure (id = 0), check the reset status. This
+    // should not be GL_NO_ERROR.
+    CHECK(driver_->fn.glGetGraphicsResetStatusARBFn);
+    CHECK_NE(glGetGraphicsResetStatusARBFn(), /*GL_NO_ERROR*/ 0u);
   }
 }
 
